<title>USA: Morgan Stanley, Dean Witter press conference set.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley, Dean Witter press conference set.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Group Inc and Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co said they will host an analyst meeting/press conference Wednesday at 1030 EST/1530 GMT at the Equitable Building in New York City.</p>
<p>the two financial institutions earlier said they will merge into a company with a market capitalization of $21 billion, the largest securities firm in the United States.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsroom 212 869-1610))</p>
</text>
